WEBVTT

00:05:58.322 --> 00:06:00.212
Children are our future,

00:06:00.236 --> 00:06:03.457
and they will learn to give care
in the ways we give care.

00:06:04.429 --> 00:06:07.585
Sexual consent doesn't
have to be a mood killer

00:06:07.609 --> 00:06:09.677
or "the talk" either.

00:06:09.701 --> 00:06:14.050
Like circus, it can be joyful,
fun and exciting.

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:18.567
Our intimate experiences
should not only be safe,

00:06:18.591 --> 00:06:21.089
but as thrilling
as flying through the air.

00:06:22.016 --> 00:06:23.166
Thank you.